# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

📦 medsim - Simulation Infrastructure for the Mediationverse
────────────────────────────────────────────────

📍 LOCATION
~/projects/r-packages/active/medsim/

📋 DESCRIPTION
Monte Carlo simulation infrastructure for mediation methods across the
mediationverse (medfit, probmed, RMediation, medrobust). Version 0.1.1.

🔗 medfit dependency: **Suggests** `medfit (>= 0.1.0)` + `Remotes: Data-Wise/medfit`.
Soft (optional) dependency — not part of the hard post-CRAN cascade; drop the
Remotes line whenever convenient after medfit reaches CRAN.

🩺 HEALTH (audited 2026-06-03)
- Tests: ~193 `test_that` blocks (healthy).
- NEWS.md present (dev-version header), README present, pkgdown configured.

